      "summary": "Shoreham Flyover \u2192 Brighton North Street",
      "description": "This route would offer a high-quality fast way to travel from west to east towards Brighton. It has been a historical bus route which has been slowly removed from the map. With a little love and attention, this route can be slightly adapted to give many more people a local bus stop with quick access into the city centre. You can view the history of Route 20/20X and 60 here: https://history.buses.co.uk/history/route/routes.htm#:~:text=by%20Compass%20Travel-,Service%2020,-Pictures",
